WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.814 --> 00:00:03.856
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD EVENING AND

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:04.488
WELCOME TO

00:00:04.489 --> 00:00:05.597
"TUCKER CARLSON TONIGHT."

00:00:05.598 --> 00:00:07.827
BELIEVE IT OR NOT, THIS IS

00:00:07.828 --> 00:00:09.378
JOE BIDEN’S THIRD ATTEMPT TO RUN

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:09.790
FOR PRESIDENT.

00:00:09.824 --> 00:00:14.181
HISTORY IS LOST WHEN YOU LIVE IN

00:00:14.183 --> 00:00:16.706
THEINTHE ETERNAL PRESENT AS WE A

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:17.249
NOW.

00:00:17.251 --> 00:00:19.973
THE FIRST TIME BIDEN RAN WAS IN

00:00:20.007 --> 00:00:21.183
1988, THAT WAS BEFORE MOST OF

00:00:21.217 --> 00:00:22.984
THE PEOPLE WHO WORK ON THE SHOW

00:00:23.019 --> 00:00:24.872
WERE BORN AND HE WAS CAUGHT

00:00:24.873 --> 00:00:26.990
LYING ABOUT HIS BIOGRAPHY AND

00:00:26.992 --> 00:00:28.644
SPEECHES AND FORCED TO DROP OUT.

00:00:28.679 --> 00:00:30.171
BIDEN SUGGESTED TO AUDIENCES

00:00:30.172 --> 00:00:32.487
THAT HE HAD GROWN UP IN A COAL

00:00:32.488 --> 00:00:33.918
MINING FAMILY IN WALES.

00:00:33.953 --> 00:00:35.164
THAT’S NOT TRUE.

00:00:35.199 --> 00:00:36.681
JOE BIDEN IS ACTUALLY FROM

00:00:36.682 --> 00:00:39.810
AMERICA, HIS FATHER SOLD CARS IN

00:00:39.844 --> 00:00:40.285
WILMINGTON.

00:00:40.287 --> 00:00:41.850
BIDEN WENT TO CATHOLIC PREP

00:00:41.851 --> 00:00:43.008
SCHOOL IN THE SUBURBS.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.758
IT TOOK 20 YEARS BEFORE BIDEN

00:00:44.759 --> 00:00:47.317
RAN AGAIN AND WHEN HE DID, IT

00:00:47.351 --> 00:00:48.899
DID NOT GO WELL.

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:50.969
IN 2008, JOE BIDEN GOT A TOTAL

00:00:51.003 --> 00:00:52.492
OF 1% OF THE VOTE IN THE IOWA

00:00:52.494 --> 00:00:53.068
CAUCUSES.

00:00:53.102 --> 00:00:54.797
HE DROPPED OUT THAT NIGHT.

00:00:54.798 --> 00:00:56.565
JOE BIDEN, WHATEVER HIS

00:00:56.566 --> 00:00:58.749
STRENGTHS, TURNED OUT TO BE SO

00:00:58.784 --> 00:00:59.853
BAD AT RUNNING FOR PRESIDENT

00:00:59.887 --> 00:01:01.526
THAT EVEN BARACK OBAMA,

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.518
SUPPOSEDLY HIS CLOSE FRIEND,

00:01:03.519 --> 00:01:05.186
REPEATEDLY REFUSED TO ENDORSE

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.207
HIM.

00:01:06.241 --> 00:01:10.265
"HE JUST CAN’T WIN," THAT WAS

00:01:10.266 --> 00:01:11.670
BARACK OBAMA’S VIEW.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.765
THEN THE WUHAN CORONAVIRUS

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.391
ARRIVED.

00:01:13.425 --> 00:01:15.261
DEMOCRATIC LAWMAKERS CHECKED ON

00:01:15.263 --> 00:01:16.961
THE COUNTRY, MILLIONS LOST THEIR

00:01:16.963 --> 00:01:18.660
JOBS, AMERICANS HUDDLED IN THEIR

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:20.777
HOMES, CUT OFF FROM ONE ANOTHER

00:01:20.811 --> 00:01:22.281
AND DEEPLY MISERABLE.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:23.450
FROM HIS BASEMENT, STRATEGICALLY

00:01:23.451 --> 00:01:24.232
CLOISTERED AWAY IN SILENCE,

00:01:24.233 --> 00:01:25.233
JOE BIDEN SHOT AHEAD IN THE

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:25.805
POLLS.

00:01:25.806 --> 00:01:28.484
NOT BECAUSE OF ANYTHING HE DID,

00:01:28.485 --> 00:01:30.267
HE JUST HAPPENS TO BE THERE.

00:01:30.301 --> 00:01:33.336
AS OF TONIGHT, JOE BIDEN COULD

00:01:33.337 --> 00:01:34.699
WIN THE RACE.

00:01:34.733 --> 00:01:36.093
UNFORTUNATELY, IF HE DOES,

00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:37.221
JOE BIDEN CANNOT GOVERN THE

00:01:37.223 --> 00:01:37.513
COUNTRY.

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:38.904
HE HAS ALL BUT ADMITTED THAT, HE

00:01:38.905 --> 00:01:41.171
SAID HE WON’T RUN FOR A SECOND

00:01:41.205 --> 00:01:41.787
TERM.

00:01:41.789 --> 00:01:44.248
SO BIDEN’S RUNNING MATE WILL BE

00:01:44.282 --> 00:01:45.943
THE MOST CONSEQUENTIAL VP PICK

00:01:45.944 --> 00:01:47.556
IN AMERICAN HISTORY AND SOON WE

00:01:47.591 --> 00:01:48.546
WILL KNOW WHO IT IS.

00:01:48.548 --> 00:01:51.234
APPARENTLY THE ANNOUNCEMENT IS

00:01:51.268 --> 00:01:55.246
COMING IN THE NEXT WEEK.

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:57.466
SENATOR KAMALA HARRIS IN

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:59.124
CALIFORNIA IS THE FRONT RUNNER,

00:01:59.158 --> 00:02:00.102
SHE CERTAINLY THE MOST

00:02:00.104 --> 00:02:00.716
WELL-KNOWN.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.147
NEEDLESS TO SAY, THEY LOVE HER.

00:02:03.149 --> 00:02:04.570
SHE’S ONE OF THEM.

00:02:04.572 --> 00:02:07.302
THE PUBLIC, THOUGH, HAS BEEN

00:02:07.337 --> 00:02:08.601
MUCH LESS IMPRESSED INCLUDING

00:02:08.635 --> 00:02:08.981
DEMOCRATS.

00:02:09.015 --> 00:02:10.193
HARRIS WAS SO UNPOPULAR WITH

00:02:10.194 --> 00:02:11.390
DEMOCRATIC PRIMARY VOTERS THAT

00:02:11.424 --> 00:02:12.980
SHE NEVER MADE IT TO THE FIRST

00:02:13.014 --> 00:02:14.142
VOTE IN THE PRIMARY.

00:02:14.177 --> 00:02:15.448
WHEN SHE DROPPED OUT IN

00:02:15.449 --> 00:02:18.935
DECEMBER, HARRIS WAS PULLING

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:20.026
AROUND 3%.

00:02:20.027 --> 00:02:22.192
THE WRAP AND EXIT POLLS IS THAT

00:02:22.226 --> 00:02:23.316
SHE’S A FRAUD, SHE DOESN’T

00:02:23.317 --> 00:02:25.023
REALLY BELIEVE IN ANYTHING AND

00:02:25.057 --> 00:02:27.169
SHE WILL SAY WHATEVER IT TAKES.

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.697
THAT IS ALSO HARRIS’ PRIMARY

00:02:28.698 --> 00:02:29.184
STRENGTH.

00:02:29.218 --> 00:02:31.474
HERE SHE IS PROMISING FREE

00:02:31.509 --> 00:02:33.362
HEALTH CARE TO ILLEGAL ALIENS.

00:02:33.363 --> 00:02:34.572
&gt;&gt; SO YOU SUPPORT GIVING

00:02:34.573 --> 00:02:35.844
UNIVERSAL HEALTH CARE, MEDICARE

00:02:35.846 --> 00:02:37.360
FOR ALL TO PEOPLE WHO ARE IN

00:02:37.394 --> 00:02:38.699
THIS COUNTRY ILLEGALLY?

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:41.442
&gt;&gt; LET ME BE VERY CLEAR ABOUT

00:02:41.444 --> 00:02:44.353
THIS, I AM OPPOSED TO ANY POLICY

00:02:44.354 --> 00:02:46.830
THAT WOULD DENY IN OUR COUNTRY

00:02:46.831 --> 00:02:49.561
ANY HUMAN BEING FROM ACCESS TO

00:02:49.562 --> 00:02:51.903
PUBLIC SAFETY, PUBLIC EDUCATION,

00:02:51.904 --> 00:02:53.163
OR PUBLIC HEALTH, PERIOD.

00:02:53.164 --> 00:02:55.749
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOW WAIT A SECOND,

00:02:55.751 --> 00:02:57.671
YOU MAY BE WONDERING.

00:02:57.673 --> 00:02:59.278
I’M SITTING IN MY HOUSE, MAYBE

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.287
UNEMPLOYED, PAYING A HUGE

00:03:01.321 --> 00:03:02.941
PERCENTAGE OF MY NET WORTH FOR

00:03:02.943 --> 00:03:03.586
HEALTH CARE.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.675
SO WHY SHOULD PEOPLE WHO AREN’T

00:03:04.709 --> 00:03:06.039
EVEN ALLOWED TO BE IN THIS

00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:08.318
COUNTRY IN THE FIRST PLACE GET

00:03:08.352 --> 00:03:10.281
IT FOR FREE AT MY EXPENSE?

00:03:10.316 --> 00:03:12.157
BY THE WAY, HOW CAN A GOVERNMENT

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.769
THAT’S ALREADY $27 TRILLION IN

00:03:13.803 --> 00:03:16.394
DEBT AFFORD TO PAY FOR THE REST

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:18.777
OF THE WORLD’S MEDICAL BILLS?

00:03:18.811 --> 00:03:20.750
THOSE ARE ALL GOOD QUESTIONS.

00:03:20.784 --> 00:03:22.471
KAMALA HARRIS HAS NO ANSWERS,

00:03:22.506 --> 00:03:24.306
FIXING THE PROBLEM IS NOT THE

00:03:24.307 --> 00:03:25.051
POINT OF THE EXERCISE.

00:03:25.085 --> 00:03:26.284
WINNING IS THE POINT.

00:03:26.318 --> 00:03:27.384
OVER THE YEARS, HARRIS HAS BEEN

00:03:27.419 --> 00:03:29.958
WILLING TO DO PRETTY MUCH

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.973
WHATEVER IT TAKES TO WIN,

00:03:32.007 --> 00:03:34.289
INCLUDING USE THE POWER OF HER

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.495
OFFICE TO CRUSH POLITICAL

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:35.759
OPPONENTS.

00:03:35.794 --> 00:03:39.218
AS THE ATTORNEY GENERAL OF

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.837
CALIFORNIA, HARRIS RELENTLESSLY

00:03:40.839 --> 00:03:44.029
DEFENDED HER BIG DONORS, WHEN A

00:03:44.063 --> 00:03:44.941
JOURNALIST CRITICIZED PLANNED

00:03:44.942 --> 00:03:46.226
PARENTHOOD IN A DOCUMENTARY,

00:03:46.227 --> 00:03:48.383
KAMALA HARRIS SPENT THE POLICE

00:03:48.384 --> 00:03:49.312
TO HIS HOME.

00:03:49.313 --> 00:03:50.296
HE LATER DESCRIBED THE

00:03:50.297 --> 00:03:52.246
AUTHORITARIAN NIGHTMARE HARRIS

00:03:52.281 --> 00:03:54.527
UNLEASHED ON HIS LIFE.

00:03:54.562 --> 00:03:56.239
&gt;&gt; THEY GOT A HIGHLY POLITICAL

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.107
SEARCH WARRANT TO CONDUCT A

00:03:58.108 --> 00:04:01.205
POLITICAL RAID ON MY HOME

00:04:01.206 --> 00:04:02.832
DISEASE THE UNDER COVERED

00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:04.672
FOOTAGE, BLACK LETTER CALIFORNIA

00:04:04.673 --> 00:04:07.317
LAW THAT YOU ARE NOT SUPPOSED TO

00:04:07.318 --> 00:04:09.668
GET SEARCH WARRANT TO SEIZE THE

00:04:09.669 --> 00:04:10.763
UNPUBLISHED MATERIALS OF A

00:04:10.797 --> 00:04:11.490
JOURNALIST, CITIZEN JOURNALIST,

00:04:11.525 --> 00:04:13.290
PROFESSIONAL JOURNALIST BUT

00:04:13.324 --> 00:04:14.702
THAT’S WHAT KAMALA HARRIS WENT

00:04:14.703 --> 00:04:16.165
AHEAD AND DID IN ORDER TO COVER

00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:18.337
UP FOR THEM AND PROTECT THEM

00:04:18.371 --> 00:04:20.294
FROM INCREASED FURTHER SCRUTINY

00:04:20.295 --> 00:04:22.797
FOR THE CRIMES OF SELLING

00:04:22.799 --> 00:04:24.157
ABORTED BABY BODY PARTS,

00:04:24.158 --> 00:04:25.165
SOMETIMES FROM CRIMINAL

00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:25.521
PARTIAL-BIRTH ABORTIONS.

00:04:25.555 --> 00:04:28.087
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO I THINK WHAT WE

00:04:28.089 --> 00:04:29.765
CAN CONCLUDE FROM THIS EPISODE

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.147
IS THAT KAMALA HARRIS OR ANY

00:04:31.181 --> 00:04:32.699
POLITICIAN WILLING TO USE

00:04:32.733 --> 00:04:34.318
LAW ENFORCEMENT TO STOP

00:04:34.319 --> 00:04:35.237
JOURNALISM SHE DOESN’T LIKE

00:04:35.238 --> 00:04:36.791
PROBABLY DOESN’T CARE TOO MUCH

00:04:36.792 --> 00:04:38.701
ABOUT CIVIL LIBERTIES OR

00:04:38.735 --> 00:04:41.997
EQUALITY UNDER THE LAW, AND

00:04:42.031 --> 00:04:43.545
INDEED SHE DOESN’T.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.842
HARRIS SUPPORTS ALLOWING

00:04:45.877 --> 00:04:48.573
UNIVERSITIES TO HIRE AN EMPLOYER

00:04:48.575 --> 00:04:50.899
BASED ON THE SKIN COLOR OF

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:51.736
APPLICANTS.

00:04:51.738 --> 00:04:54.232
SHE’D LIKE TO REWRITE THE

00:04:54.234 --> 00:04:55.821
CONSTITUTION TO ELIMINATE THE

00:04:55.856 --> 00:04:57.224
ELECTORAL COLLEGE BECAUSE IT’S

00:04:57.259 --> 00:04:57.527
INCONVENIENT.

00:04:57.528 --> 00:04:59.627
JUST TEN YEARS AGO, BARACK OBAMA

00:04:59.628 --> 00:05:01.156
WOULD’VE RUN AWAY FROM THEM,

00:05:01.191 --> 00:05:02.527
THAT’S A MUCH THE DEMOCRATIC

00:05:02.528 --> 00:05:03.407
PARTY HAS CHANGED.

00:05:03.408 --> 00:05:04.719
IF YOU’RE LOOKING FOR MORE

00:05:04.753 --> 00:05:05.620
EVIDENCE OF THAT CHANGE, YOU

00:05:05.622 --> 00:05:08.280
SHOULD ALSO KNOW THAT JOE BIDEN

00:05:08.281 --> 00:05:09.449
IS CONSIDERING CONGRESSWOMAN

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.875
KAREN BASS OF LOS ANGELES AS HIS

00:05:11.876 --> 00:05:13.110
RUNNING MATE, SHE’S ALSO ON THE

00:05:13.111 --> 00:05:14.669
SHORT LIST.

00:05:14.671 --> 00:05:17.087
UNLIKE KAMALA HARRIS, KAREN BASS

00:05:17.088 --> 00:05:19.455
IS NOT A FRAUD.

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.537
KAREN BASS MEANS IT.

00:05:21.538 --> 00:05:22.448
SHE’S SINCERE.

00:05:22.449 --> 00:05:23.478
AN UNAPOLOGETIC LEFT-WING BOMB

00:05:23.513 --> 00:05:25.483
THROWER WHO SPENT DECADES

00:05:25.485 --> 00:05:27.493
WORKING TO HELP FIDEL CASTRO AND

00:05:27.494 --> 00:05:28.636
HIS COLD WAR AGAINST THE

00:05:28.637 --> 00:05:29.851
UNITED STATES.

00:05:29.853 --> 00:05:31.140
KAREN BASS KEPT PRAISING

00:05:31.141 --> 00:05:33.185
FIDEL CASTRO ALL THE WAY TO HIS

00:05:33.187 --> 00:05:34.571
DEATH FOUR YEARS AGO.

00:05:34.573 --> 00:05:36.736
IN THE 1970s, KAREN BASS

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.827
BELONGS TO A GROUP THAT THE L.A.

00:05:39.861 --> 00:05:41.036
POLICE DEPARTMENT ACCUSED OF

00:05:41.037 --> 00:05:43.750
TREADING REVOLUTIONARIES IN

00:05:43.784 --> 00:05:45.704
"TERRORIST TACTICS AND GUERRILLA

00:05:45.739 --> 00:05:46.097
WARFARE."

