BASS APPARENTLY VISITED CUBA

00:05:48.101 --> 00:05:50.360
MULTIPLE TIMES A YEAR.

00:05:50.361 --> 00:05:52.232
KAREN BASS IS NOT A MAINSTREAM

00:05:52.234 --> 00:05:52.610
FIGURE.

00:05:52.612 --> 00:05:54.821
SHE LITERALLY COSPONSOR TO THE

00:05:54.856 --> 00:05:56.889
NEW WAY FORWARD ACT, THAT IS A

