LUNATIC BILL THAT WOULD FORCE

00:05:59.017 --> 00:06:01.794
THE U.S. GOVERNMENT TO RE-IMPORT

00:06:01.828 --> 00:06:03.465
AT TAXPAYER EXPENSE HUNDREDS OF

00:06:03.466 --> 00:06:04.991
THOUSANDS OF ILLEGAL ALIENS THAT

00:06:04.992 --> 00:06:06.127
WE’VE DEPORTED FOR COMMITTING

00:06:06.161 --> 00:06:06.544
CRIMES.

00:06:06.545 --> 00:06:08.845
IN MANY CASE, VIOLENT CRIMES,

00:06:08.846 --> 00:06:09.890
FOR REAL.

00:06:09.925 --> 00:06:12.948
KAREN BASS IS SO EXTREME THAT

00:06:12.982 --> 00:06:15.663
LIKE KAMALA HARRIS, BY THE WAY,

00:06:15.664 --> 00:06:17.706
SHE’S CURRENTLY TRYING TO REPEAL

00:06:17.707 --> 00:06:18.378
CALIFORNIA’S MAIN

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:19.373
ANTIDISCRIMINATION LAW.

00:06:19.374 --> 00:06:20.914
BASS WANTS TO MAKE RACIAL

00:06:20.915 --> 00:06:21.965
DISCRIMINATION LEGAL AS IT WAS

00:06:21.966 --> 00:06:22.632
BEFORE THE CIVIL RIGHTS

00:06:22.666 --> 00:06:23.543
MOVEMENT.

00:06:23.544 --> 00:06:25.996
WE ARE NOT OVERSTATING THIS.

00:06:25.998 --> 00:06:27.350
KAREN BASS HAS ISSUED PRESS

00:06:27.384 --> 00:06:28.775
RELEASES BRAGGING ABOUT IT.

00:06:28.776 --> 00:06:31.169
YOU MAY NOT OF HEARD ABOUT ANY

